THE CODE is open source under the MIT License, below. That covers the engine,
the nightly dream harness, the on-chain notary, the site, the tests, and the
tooling: everything in this repository except the files listed under THE WORK.
Take it, read it, learn from it, build something of your own with it.

THE WORK is not code, and is not covered by the MIT License. It is the mind's
own writing: everything it has ever thought or dreamt.

    lib/corpus.ts           its whole vocabulary, every night's material
    lib/marginalia.ts       the notes it leaves in the margin
    corpus/nights/          each night's dream, as it was dreamt
    corpus/offerings.jsonl  what was left at its door
    corpus/anchors.jsonl    the record of it being notarised

